	JMS O2		/HALF WORD PACKING - PACK 1ST HALF
	TAD O3		/GET SAVED ARG
	JMS O2		/PACK SECOND HALF
	SM3		/RESET 3-WAY SWITCH
	DCA O2		/BUFFER CAN ONLY BE FILLED
