	JMP O1+2	/NOT FULL YET
OSUB,	TAD OLNGTH	/CHECK THE FILE SIZE (L=1)
	TAD BLKCNT	/AMOUNT USED SO FAR
	SNL CLA		/HAVE WE GONE TOO FAR?
